{"id":"4badec96813b3395","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-relation.md","title":"Relations and Function Graphs","display":"df-relation — Relations and Function Graphs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-relation","aliases":["90-df-relation"],"display":"df-relation — Relations and Function Graphs","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relation — Relations and Function Graphs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A\\times B\">\\(R\\subseteq A\\times B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq B\\times C\">\\(S\\subseteq B\\times C\\)</span>。有序对和有限元组按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a> 的集合论约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> 在此处作用于关系图；结构的同名底集投影在结构文件单独作类型化定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(a,b)\">\\(R(a,b)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\\in R\">\\((a,b)\\in R\\)</span> 的谓词写法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq A\">\\(X\\subseteq A\\)</span>。单值图的点值仅在其定义域内应用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rel}(R,A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B,\\\\\nR(a,b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(a,b)\\in R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in B\\ (a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\ (a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\nR^{-1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(b,a):(a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\nR[X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in X\\ (a,b)\\in R\\}\\quad(X\\subseteq A),\\\\\nS\\circ R&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,c)\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,c)\\in S)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\forall b,c\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(a,c)\\in R\\Rightarrow b=c),\\\\\nR:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B),\\\\\nR:A\\to B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(R)=A,\\\\\nR:A\\hookrightarrow B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow R:A\\to B\\land\n\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\ \\forall b\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(a&#39;,b)\\in R\\Rightarrow a=a&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rel}(R,A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B,\\\\\nR(a,b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(a,b)\\in R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in B\\ (a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\ (a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\nR^{-1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(b,a):(a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\nR[X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in X\\ (a,b)\\in R\\}\\quad(X\\subseteq A),\\\\\nS\\circ R&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,c)\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,c)\\in S)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\forall b,c\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(a,c)\\in R\\Rightarrow b=c),\\\\\nR:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B),\\\\\nR:A\\to B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(R)=A,\\\\\nR:A\\hookrightarrow B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow R:A\\to B\\land\n\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\ \\forall b\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(a&#39;,b)\\in R\\Rightarrow a=a&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 本书 Partial 仍由原文件定义；这里只提供其关系论底层，不把关系自动视为全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C$ 为集合，$R\\subseteq A\\times B$、$S\\subseteq B\\times C$。有序对和有限元组按 [[90-df-omega]] 的集合论约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq B\\times C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"R(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rel}(R,A,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B,\\\\\nR(a,b)&\\Longleftrightarrow(a,b)\\in R,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(R)&\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in B\\ (a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(R)&\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\ (a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\nR^{-1}&\\coloneqq\\{(b,a):(a,b)\\in R\\},\\\\\nR[X]&\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in X\\ (a,b)\\in R\\}\\quad(X\\subseteq A),\\\\\nS\\circ R&\\coloneqq\\{(a,c)\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,c)\\in S)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\forall b,c\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(a,c)\\in R\\Rightarrow b=c),\\\\\nR:A\\rightharpoonup B&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B),\\\\\nR:A\\to B&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Fun}(R,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(R)=A,\\\\\nR:A\\hookrightarrow B&\\Longleftrightarrow R:A\\to B\\land\n\\forall a,a'\\in A\\ \\forall b\\in B\\ ((a,b)\\in R\\land(a',b)\\in R\\Rightarrow a=a').\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1947,"backlinks":[{"id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"二元关系和笛卡尔积使用本地补齐的 [[90-df-relation]]；有限数值列与自然数语境由该依赖引入。"},{"id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"264cfff82242245c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffc504ac94bd0528","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]、[[90-df-relation]]、[[90-df-hilbert-bernays]] 已给出本地正文。三项同名冲突分别使用 base-fo